    "detailed_description": "Mucorales is an immersive interactive horror experience, lasting approximately 30 minutes to an hour, inviting you to delve into a dark reinterpretation of the classic Red Riding Hood fairytale. Explore the twisted narrative and witness how your choices shape the story, unraveling hidden secrets within this captivating RPG Maker tale.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on a journey with Blanchette, a young girl visiting her grandma. As she discovers unsettling truths about her and the entire forest, you'll be faced with decisions that could lead her down a path of temptation or guide her to escape the ominous woods.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEngage in conversations with diverse characters, interact with various objects, and witness a chilling story unfold before your eyes. The game offers a unique experience with the opportunity to replay and explore alternative paths, providing fresh perspectives on the narrative each time.",
